            <ArticleTitle>[Transcutaneous electrostimulation in different forms of facial pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>44-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>One hundred and twenty-eight patients with various forms of facial pain responded well to a multiple modality treatment. The treatment was based on transcutaneous electrostimulation with the help of the neurostimulant devices &quot;Neuron-01&quot; and &quot;Neuron-02&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
